      "purpose": "接入 Claude Desktop",
      "screen": "下载当前 Base 配置的 Guided 包 → Claude Settings → Extensions → 安装并启用",
      "narration": "Download the Guided package for this Base Sepolia configuration. In Claude Desktop, open Settings, Extensions and Advanced settings, then import and enable the package. Its local connection is already configured, so no Agent profile or Connection file is selected. Start a new conversation using this connection.",
