      "screen": "Claude 调用采购工具 → 已付款、服务失败、结果未检查",
      "narration": "Authorize the quoted purchase. Mandate registers the commitment before releasing a payment signature. The USDC transfer settles on Base Sepolia, but our controlled service deliberately fails its first response. Claude reports payment, delivery and result validation separately. A successful payment alone does not mean the data was delivered.",
