      "narration": "Open the settlement transaction in BaseScan. Check Success, the test USDC contract, and the ERC-twenty transfer from the smart account to the approved recipient for zero point zero one USDC. The transaction sender may be the facilitator paying gas; the token-transfer sender identifies the paying account.",
