      "start": 184.86666666666667,
      "end": 205.83333333333334,
      "purpose": "恢复原订单并生成简报",
      "screen": "Claude 重试同一 ETH 步骤 → 相同 hash 与 nonce → 返回样本与简报",
      "narration": "Claude resumes the same ETH step after checking its payment state. The original order and settlement hash are retained, and there is no second payment. The service returns the sample and the result checker validates it. Claude writes a brief, identifies the fixed demonstration dataset, and cites the settlement.",
